  "$Comment": "Bram the Shepherd's look, every piece of it the game's own: the player's body and a stubbled face chewing a stalk of wheat, short hair under a rustic brown cap, the character creator's farmer's shirt under a cream wool jersey, leather trousers and long leather boots. Parent Seasons_Of_Orbis_Villager brings the player's body, its animations and its hitbox, as Parent Player does for the temple's own Mithril Guard, and the wave he greets a player with. The body, face, mouth and ears share one skin tone (GradientSet Skin, GradientId 10): change all four together. DefaultAttachments replaces the parent's list whole, so the face pieces come first. Under a hat the character creator swaps a haircut for its generic one (HaircutFallbacks), so the hair here is GenericShort. A greyscale texture takes its colour from GradientSet and GradientId, the dyes the character creator offers players: change a GradientId to re-dye one piece.",
